// Rule: [T1555][T1539] Volta Autodoxer - Volta Debug Artifacts
// MITRE ATT&CK: T1555, T1539
// Classification: Hunting query
// Status: Untested implementation sketch
// Primary platform: Microsoft Defender XDR
// Required telemetry: DeviceFileEvents
// Purpose: Hunting query for volta debug artifacts, with evidence boundaries and target-environment validation requirements
// Logic: Evaluate DeviceFileEvents for volta debug artifacts using the existing source-derived conditions while preserving projected investigation context.
// A match proves: A result proves that the published query conditions matched in DeviceFileEvents; it is an investigative event, not a malicious verdict.
// A match does not prove: collection, AI analysis, exfiltration, or attribution.
// Expected false positives: authorized administration, approved software, testing, or benign artifact collisions.
// Coverage limits: local schema, field population, retention, collection scope, and attacker variation require validation.
// Evidence claims: C001, C002, C003
//
// Hunting query - Untested implementation sketch
// Primary platform: Microsoft Defender XDR Advanced Hunting
// Campaign-specific artifact hunt for VOLTA-AUTODOXER.
// A match does not prove collection, AI analysis, exfiltration, or attribution.
DeviceFileEvents
| where Timestamp > ago(30d)
| where SHA256 =~ "57ef4242666d78c50df145b34023df564f0fad38812d6a580e66433d427e2279"
   or (FileName =~ "volta_debug.txt" and FolderPath contains @"\AppData\Roaming\")
| project Timestamp, DeviceId, DeviceName, ActionType, FolderPath, FileName,
          SHA256, InitiatingProcessFileName, InitiatingProcessCommandLine,
          InitiatingProcessAccountName, ReportId
| order by Timestamp desc
